B = [
('Hermes', 'Europe', '1920s-present', 'luxury goods', 'In the style of Hermes, quiet Parisian luxury rooted in saddlery and patient hand craft. A vivid saturated orange dominates, set against chocolate brown, cream, black, deep navy, bright pink and warm gold, usually in flat solid blocks. Surfaces are smooth or finely pebbled leather with crisp painted edges and visible, slightly slanted hand stitching in contrasting thread. Forms are structured, upright and trapezoid, with slim straps, small turn locks and gleaming palladium or gold hardware. Dense multicolour silk-twill prints show horses, bridles, chains, stirrups, flowers and feathers inside busy bordered squares with hand-rolled edges. Packaging is a plain orange lidded box tied with brown ribbon. Lettering is small, discreet, upright capitals. Photography is bright, airy, witty and uncluttered.'),
('Ralph Lauren', 'North America', '1970s-present', 'fashion', 'In the style of Ralph Lauren, nostalgic old-money American heritage, part ivy campus, part country club, part western ranch. Palette is deep forest green, navy, burgundy, camel, cream and crisp white, with a bright red accent. Patterns include cable knit, madras and tartan plaids, herringbone tweed, Fair Isle bands, blanket stripes and stars and stripes motifs. Materials are oxford cloth, wool, corduroy, weathered saddle leather and brass buttons. A small embroidered mounted rider on a polo pony sits quietly as a mark, alongside bold collegiate numbers and crests. Lettering is spaced serif capitals in gold on dark navy or green storefront signs. Photography is warm, sunlit, aspirational and storied, with wood panelling, dogs, horses and autumn light.'),
('Lacoste', 'Europe', '1930s-present', 'sportswear', 'In the style of Lacoste, polished tennis-club elegance with a playful, confident wink. Textured cotton pique with a small knit weave, ribbed edges and a clean, relaxed fit. A single small green crocodile sits quietly as the only mark, while campaigns scale it up into giant sculptural reptiles in layered green paper and fabric facets, set on bright backdrops. Palette is tennis white plus deep bottle green, navy, red, sky blue and yellow, in solid blocks and bold stripes. Terry cloth bands, white canvas, crisp laundered surfaces and white court lines add sport cues. Lettering is simple, slim, spaced sans-serif capitals. Photography is bright, sunlit and graphic, with energetic poses against flat colour fields and lawn green.'),
('Tiffany and Co', 'North America', '1840s-present', 'jewellery and luxury', 'In the style of Tiffany and Co, polished New York prestige built around one pale robin-egg turquoise blue. Smooth matte blue boxes and bags with crisp square corners are wrapped in white satin ribbon tied in a simple bow, and the blue appears as flat backgrounds, tinted glass and pastel surfaces in every setting. Metals are bright sterling silver, platinum and soft yellow gold, with clean sparkling stones in simple claw settings, chunky links, hammered texture and engraved leaf borders. Lettering is fine, wide-spaced serif capitals in black or silver. Photography is luminous, romantic and airy, with glossy reflections, soft glow and witty still-life arrangements of ordinary things in the signature blue. Elegant, clean and quietly exclusive.'),
('Lego', 'Europe', '1970s-present', 'toys and play', 'In the style of Lego, glossy hard plastic in saturated primary red, blue, yellow and white plus black, grey and bright lime and orange. Everything is a rectangular modular volume with a regular grid of round studs on top, crisp moulded edges and visible seams, so any subject reads as assembled from simple bricks. Characters have cylindrical yellow heads with dot eyes and a simple smile, claw hands and blocky bodies. Packaging and graphics use flat bright colour fields, a red square badge with white rounded lettering, small clean line diagrams and dynamic action imagery. Cardboard and kraft textures appear in newer eco touches. Photography is bright, playful and toy-scale, with tiny scenes in macro focus and cheerful humour.'),
]
